DESIGN GOAL:

I wanted the villagers to have a purpose in the village, so I assigned each of them a job. Each villager completes their job and every villager recognizes that job.

REFLECTION:

To complete this task, I used behavioral blocks. I gave some villagers the same roles as others so they could complete the same tasks. Additionally, this allowed them to more easily identify
and respond to different villager types.

AI USE:

I used Claude Code to help with the project. It helped modify and improve my code, as well as fix any problems or errors. Any code it helped write, I read over and tested the agent to see if there were still any
problems. It definitely made the experience easier and faster.
